{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    ", quick questions to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", kurze Fragen an %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ", quick questions with %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", kurze Fragen mit %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything is read with %@: through the beeserver with Pro, or %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles wird mit %@ gelesen: mit Pro über den Beeserver, oder %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read, sorted and digested with %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gelesen, einsortiert und zusammengefasst mit %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read and sorted with %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gelesen und einsortiert mit %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each item's digest, and each matter's brief and next step, with %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Überblick zu jedem Stück, und Zusammenfassung und nächster Schritt jedes Anliegens, mit %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each matter's brief and next step with %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zusammenfassung und nächster Schritt jedes Anliegens mit %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chat with %@%@. ": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Chat mit %@%@. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each model was chosen only after it did its job as well as GPT-6.1 Sol. All of them get only pseudonymised text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jedes Modell wurde erst gewählt, nachdem es seine Aufgabe so gut erledigt hat wie GPT-6.1 Sol. Alle bekommen nur pseudonymisierten Text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "all day": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ganztägig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · there ": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · dort "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · done": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · erledigt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No time yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch keine Zeit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kalender"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reminders": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erinnerungen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee could not make its list “%@” in %@%@. ": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee konnte seine Liste „%@“ in %@%@ nicht anlegen. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make a list called “%@” there, or choose a list in Settings → Calendar and Reminders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leg dort eine Liste namens „%@“ an, oder wähl in den Einstellungen → Kalender und Erinnerungen eine Liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No API key for this AI model yet. Add one in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch kein API-Key für dieses KI-Modell. Füg einen in den Einstellungen hinzu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service did not accept the API key. Check it in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der KI-Dienst hat den API-Key nicht angenommen. Prüf ihn in den Einstellungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee Pro has ended. Apple's model on this device reads what comes in; Pro comes back with the subscription.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee Pro ist beendet. Apples Modell auf diesem Gerät liest, was hereinkommt; mit dem Abo kommt Pro zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This month's Pro is used up. Apple's model on this device reads what comes in until it starts anew.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro ist für diesen Monat aufgebraucht. Bis es neu beginnt, liest Apples Modell auf diesem Gerät, was hereinkommt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today's share of Pro is used. It goes on tomorrow; Apple's model on this device reads what comes in meanwhile.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der heutige Anteil von Pro ist aufgebraucht. Morgen geht es weiter; bis dahin liest Apples Modell auf diesem Gerät, was hereinkommt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service says the account has no credit left. Top it up with the provider, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der KI-Dienst sagt, das Konto hat kein Guthaben mehr. Lad es beim Anbieter auf und versuch es dann noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service does not know this model. Choose another in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der KI-Dienst kennt dieses Modell nicht. Wähl in den Einstellungen ein anderes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service took too long to answer. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der KI-Dienst hat zu lange gebraucht. Versuch es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is too much text for the AI model at once. Try with less, or choose another model in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist auf einmal zu viel Text für das KI-Modell. Versuch es mit weniger, oder wähl in den Einstellungen ein anderes Modell."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many requests to the AI service just now. Wait a minute, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gerade zu viele Anfragen an den KI-Dienst. Warte eine Minute und versuch es dann noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service is busy right now. Try again in a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der KI-Dienst ist gerade beschäftigt. Versuch es in einer Minute noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service had a problem of its own. Try again in a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim KI-Dienst selbst ist etwas schiefgegangen. Versuch es in einer Minute noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service could not take the request. Try again; if it stays, choose another model in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der KI-Dienst konnte die Anfrage nicht annehmen. Versuch es noch einmal; bleibt es dabei, wähl in den Einstellungen ein anderes Modell."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI's answer could not be read. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Antwort der KI war nicht lesbar. Versuch es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI model declined to answer this. Try other words, or choose another model in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das KI-Modell hat die Antwort abgelehnt. Versuch es mit anderen Worten, oder wähl in den Einstellungen ein anderes Modell."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI's answer was too long and was cut off. Try again, or ask about less at once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Antwort der KI war zu lang und wurde abgeschnitten. Versuch es noch einmal, oder frag nach weniger auf einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No connection to the internet. Nothing was sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine Verbindung zum Internet. Es wurde nichts gesendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection was lost on the way. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindung ist unterwegs abgebrochen. Versuch es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No answer came in time. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es kam keine Antwort in der Zeit. Versuch es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service could not be reached. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Dienst war nicht erreichbar. Versuch es gleich noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No secure connection could be made. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es kam keine sichere Verbindung zustande. Versuch es noch einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gestoppt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection to the mail server dropped on the way — the network may have changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindung zum Mailserver ist unterwegs abgebrochen — das Netz hat sich vielleicht geändert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not set": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nicht gesetzt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld min": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld Min."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld h": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld Std."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld h %lld min": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld Std. %lld Min."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A closed matter takes no new subject": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein abgeschlossenes Anliegen nimmt kein neues Thema auf"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written from this matter in Causabee": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus diesem Anliegen in Causabee geschrieben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follows its thread": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folgt seinem Thread"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yours to place": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von dir einzuordnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf diesem Gerät gelesen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not sent: ": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "nicht gesendet: "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · written from Causabee": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · aus Causabee geschrieben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · sent by you, no label": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · von dir gesendet, kein Label"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " · no label": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · kein Label"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mail %@ is no longer in the mailbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Mail %@ ist nicht mehr im Postfach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to disguise": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nichts unkenntlich zu machen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 item disguised": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 Angabe unkenntlich gemacht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld items disguised": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld Angaben unkenntlich gemacht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your question had nothing to disguise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In deiner Frage war nichts unkenntlich zu machen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 item in your question was disguised.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 Angabe in deiner Frage wurde unkenntlich gemacht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld items in your question were disguised.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld Angaben in deiner Frage wurden unkenntlich gemacht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " With the matter's facts, %lld went out disguised — names, places, companies, addresses, numbers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " Mit den Fakten des Anliegens gingen %lld unkenntlich hinaus — Namen, Orte, Firmen, Adressen, Nummern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gestoppt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list of names at %@ cannot be read, so nothing was sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Namensliste unter %@ ist nicht lesbar, darum wurde nichts gesendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New task": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neue Aufgabe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New note": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neue Notiz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New link": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neuer Link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New detail": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neues Detail"
