    },
    "New contact": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neuer Kontakt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type or say what is to do. A day or a time in it becomes its date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schreib oder sag, was zu tun ist. Ein Tag oder eine Zeit darin wird sein Termin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type or say it. It is kept in the matter's notes, word for word.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schreib oder sag es. Es wird Wort für Wort in den Notizen des Anliegens gesichert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address, and a name for it if you like. Kept with the matter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Adresse, und wenn du magst ein Name dafür. Wird beim Anliegen gesichert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it is — a number, a code, an account — and what it says.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was es ist — eine Nummer, ein Code, ein Konto — und was darin steht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who it is, and what they are to this matter if you like.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer es ist, und wenn du magst, was die Person für dieses Anliegen ist."
